<title>FRANCE: Monster traffic jams around Paris...again.</title>
<headline>Monster traffic jams around Paris...again.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Driving rain and a strike on some suburban commuter lines on Tuesday resulted in over 300 km (180 miles) of logjams on roads leading into the French capital, police said.</p>
<p>The tailbacks in the morning rush hour were among the worst of the year and equal to those last November and December during a public transport strike, police said.</p>
</text>
